@startuml User_TourMap_SSD

actor "User\n(Tourist/Guest)" as User
participant "UI: Tour Map" as UI
participant "Database" as DB

== Access Tour Map ==

User -> UI: Access tour map
activate UI

UI -> DB: Fetch tour pins (sites)
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return pins list
deactivate DB

UI --> User: Display 3D map with all site pins
deactivate UI

== View Map with Layers ==

User -> UI: Interact with map\n(zoom, pan, rotate, tilt)
activate UI

UI -> UI: Render 3D buildings\nand site pins

UI --> User: Display updated map view
deactivate UI

== Search Site ==

User -> UI: Click "Search" button
activate UI

UI --> User: Display search modal

User -> UI: Enter site name or browse list

UI -> UI: Filter pins by search term

UI --> User: Display search results

User -> UI: Select site from results

UI -> UI: Fly to selected site\n(zoom in, tilt camera)

UI --> User: Display site pin highlighted
deactivate UI

== View Site Details ==

User -> UI: Click on site pin
activate UI

UI -> UI: Fly to site location\n(zoom: 19.5, pitch: 60°)

UI --> User: Display site card with:\n- Site name\n- Description\n- Category\n- Photos (swipeable gallery)\n- Entrance fee\n- AR Model button (if available)

deactivate UI

== View AR Model ==

User -> UI: Click "View AR Model" button
activate UI

alt AR model available
    UI --> User: Open AR viewer\n(3D model in AR space)
else No AR model
    UI --> User: Show "No AR model available"
end

deactivate UI

== View Site Photos ==

User -> UI: Swipe through photo gallery
activate UI

UI --> User: Display photos in carousel

User -> UI: Click photo to enlarge

UI --> User: Open full-screen photo viewer
deactivate UI

== Toggle Map Legend ==

User -> UI: Click "Legend" button
activate UI

UI --> User: Show/hide legend\n(site categories with icons)

deactivate UI

== Close Site Details ==

User -> UI: Click "Close" or back
activate UI

UI -> UI: Reset camera view\n(zoom out to initial view)

UI --> User: Display full map
deactivate UI

== Access Chatbot ==

User -> UI: Click chatbot icon
activate UI

UI --> User: Open chatbot interface

User -> UI: Ask questions

UI -> DB: Fetch chatbot responses
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return information
deactivate DB

UI --> User: Display chatbot response
deactivate UI

@enduml
